5339728_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=XAcRWa6RMyoQ7kNvwFGzP9O&_nc_oc=AdofxJ_H98VagduvqRBsIatVv6jEA0eQ_txgiD5pebhwj8RaZML9k4UvI5jbiz_nDxU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af276MbRw2UzuR2Yc4WMkb0ipuBZOZW0aE3sK-0AbD4TYA&oe=69F20B32"}, {"file_name": "landscape_4.png", "id": "5564456170299960", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/65402515_5564456173633293_8166203934336264507_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=mVz7gG-XZNMQ7kNvwFtFAGf&_nc_oc=Adr6R_TyZJ2zB_LhS8V99-Prpn02Xq9NabsUilwcGXfkQZ4wHnp49qdoxqJqjIzUmWo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af0i0w4-qKMAJsdaPq_w6jQKdT_WH9QjPbYuKOYB0KIDTg&oe=69F1EBF6"}, {"file_name": "landscape_5.png", "id": "634797031492068", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001717_634797034825401_6944852042907467801_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=_9p62hc4jjIQ7kNvwETnohm&_nc_oc=AdqaHKpUxExmwOdFzTCeOKD-nLjtTM3rwaqyZM_VXUIrS7fMDW4jqWzF2w-n_nkMf18&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af1y6mZNFPO8u-kj19ajEOiXFno-iTbPqmKz1F2MR9onLg&oe=69F209EB"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Notre-Dame de Paris: Voyage dans le Pass\u00e9", "keywords": ["NotreDameDeParis", "NotreDame", "Paris"], "long_description": "(Re)-d\u00e9couvrez Notre-Dame de Paris telle qu\u2019elle \u00e9tait il y a 2 si\u00e8cles, pendant la R\u00e9volution Fran\u00e7aise. Au c\u0153ur du jeu vid\u00e9o Assassin\u2019s Creed : Unity, la reconstitution 3D de la cath\u00e9drale a n\u00e9cessit\u00e9 5000 heures de travail graphique, guid\u00e9 par des historiens.\nDe la nef \u00e0 la fl\u00e8che, admirez chaque perspective du monument, et finissez par un spectaculaire voyage en ballon au-dessus des arches, et de Paris \u00e0 la fin du XVIII\u00e8me si\u00e8cle. Le tout au son d\u2019une fantaisie de Bach jou\u00e9e sur le c\u00e9l\u00e8bre orgue Cavaill\u00e9-Coll !", "short_description": "Ubis